name: capability
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: true
note: a capability flipped from absent (or chartered-but-unbuilt) to
      demonstrated — witnessed by a probe or gate, not by intent.
      Declared 2026-10-13: the resource world became inspectable —
      holds.log records mint/release/session spans and a successor reads
      them through its own read verb. Fires when "can it" gains a receipt,
      not when the surface gets wider.
